id: pm-mg13iz
title: "GH-1185: hash-only merge receipts make discarded scalar values unreachable to the reviewing agent"
description: "On pm 2026.9.3, merge decisions retain pm_value_hash while base, ours, and theirs are null and value_availability is hash_only. pm merge report exposes the same data, so explicit acceptance requires out-of-band git archaeology. Low-cardinality hashes are cheaply enumerable while free-text hashes are irrecoverable, providing neither reliable confidentiality nor actionable review evidence."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-03T18:06:37.336Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-04T06:43:10.510Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-04T06:43:09.912Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-04T06:43:09.912Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "A documented bounded policy distinguishes inline, redacted, truncated, and hash-only values; at least one supported SDK/CLI report path returns reviewable discarded evidence when policy permits; receipts never claim recoverability when only a digest exists; low-cardinality and free-text privacy negative controls pass; reconciliation and explicit acceptance remain auditable and backward compatible"
parent: pm-dj98
risk: critical
confidence: high
severity: high
environment: pm-cli 2026.9.3; Node 26.5.0; Linux; fresh merge-driver install
repro_steps: "Create divergent scalar values, merge to produce a field decision, then inspect the receipt and pm merge report; confirm base/ours/theirs are null and no command returns the discarded value."
resolution: "Durable receipts now preserve allowlisted low-cardinality scalar previews with hashes, keep arbitrary values hash-only, report truthful availability, and validate policy/composition/identity consistently."
expected_result: Supported SDK and CLI receipt reads make permitted discarded values reviewable after cloning without leaking free-form values or weakening reconciliation.
actual_result: "Fresh-clone, privacy, malformed-evidence, composition-policy, health integration, exact coverage, static quality, and packed acceptance tests passed."
component: sdk/merge-receipts
