comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-03T18:06:37.336Z","harness:codex","GitHub source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1185. All-status duplicate check searched discarded value, hash-only, merge report, and value availability. pm-z1z96w shipped truthful proof-backed reconciliation for hash-only receipts and pm-rh98vo shipped durable receipt discovery, but their live resolutions do not provide a readable discarded value. This report is a recurrence/boundary extension and receives a new item linked to both shipped lineages."
  "2026-09-03T18:07:08.922Z","harness:codex","GitHub linkage comment: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1185#issuecomment-5530007658"
  "2026-09-04T05:49:52.771Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: durable receipts now use bounded_non_sensitive_scalars_v1. Built-in statuses, bounded priority 0..4, bounded risk/confidence/severity vocabulary, and null may be reviewed inline; all other values remain hash-only. Reader validation shares the writer allowlist and rejects schema, identity, value-policy, or hash mismatches. Fresh-clone tests prove reviewable retained/discarded values survive without ancestor blobs while sensitive free-form values do not leak."
  "2026-09-04T06:23:32.966Z","harness:codex","Final repository verification: pnpm quality:static passed the complete mandatory static gate; node scripts/run-tests.mjs coverage passed 603 files and 8,350 tests at exact 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines; pnpm security:scan, pnpm audit, documentation links, and package-artifact checks passed. GitHub Dependabot, code-scanning, and secret-scanning alert inventories were empty. Focused receipt and fresh-clone reviewability tests passed."
  "2026-09-04T06:42:49.025Z","harness:codex","Terminal closeout evidence: exact-tree coverage passed 603 files and 8,351 tests at 100/100/100/100; durable validation now additionally rejects sidecars whose declared availability or versioned policy does not match their actual inline/hash composition, and the complete static-quality pipeline passed."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-04T06:22:42.332Z","harness:codex","Fresh-clone reviewability and receipt privacy require one versioned allowlist shared by the writer and reader: bounded non-sensitive scalars may be durable inline, while arbitrary strings remain hash-only."
